  "title": "Bacon Jam",
  "description": "Bacon is the beginning of a sweet, savory, and smoky spread that&#39;s just irresistible on a biscuit, with crusty bread, or added to scrambled eggs. The flavors of onion, maple syrup, and bourbon whiskey add complexity.",
